  "name": "Business, Innovation, Science and Trade Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Business, Innovation, Science and Trade Committee scrutinises the policy, spending and administration of the Department for Business, Innovation, Science and Trade and its public bodies.</p>\r\n<p>Our <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/783/business-and-trade-subcommittee-on-economic-security-arms-and-export-controls/\">Sub-Committee on Economic Security, Arms and Export Controls</a>&nbsp;scrutinises key elements of the UK Government’s economic security regime, and considers whether more needs to be done to ensure that its strategy can meet the challenges of an increasingly volatile geopolitical landscape.</p>\r\n<p>Previous publications on the scrutiny of International Trade can be found on the website of the <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/367/international-trade-committee/\">International Trade Committee</a>, which was disbanded in April 2023.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees/\">LinkedIn</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Subscribe to the Committee Corridor newsletter</a> for a weekly round-up of news, inquiry updates and reports from House of Commons committees.</p>",
